  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Thinly slice carrot into half-moons. Finely chop garlic.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68369e1442dc4b928197e4a5/step-07d38b00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat enough olive oil to coat base over medium-high heat.\n• Cook plant-based crumbed chicken until golden and heated through, 2-3 minutes on each side.\n• Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate. Sprinkle with lemon pepper seasoning and cover to keep warm.\n• Wipe out and return frying pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook carrot, stirring occasionally, until softened, 3-4 minutes. Add garlic and cook until fragrant, 1 minute.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68369e1442dc4b928197e4a5/step-21495810.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Return chicken to pan, then add red pesto, stirring to coat. Add the water, couscous and vegetable stock. Stir to combine.\n• Bring to the boil, cover with a lid, then remove from heat. Set aside until liquid is absorbed and chicken is cooked through, 5 minutes.\n• When the couscous is ready, fluff up with a fork. Stir through baby spinach leaves until wilted. Season with salt and pepper to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68369e1442dc4b928197e4a5/step-b51cdc20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Roughly chop parsley leaves.\n• Divide pesto couscous between bowls. Top with crumbed chick'n.\n• Drizzle with creamy pesto dressing. Garnish with parsley to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68369e1442dc4b928197e4a5/step-3be41530.jpg"
    }
  ]
